    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nWe are delighted to present to the market this attractive parcel of land extending to approximately 4.0 acres (1.62 hectares) at Derryloughan West, Furbo, Co. Galway. Situated in a highly desirable coastal location, the property enjoys approximately 70 metres of road frontage onto the R336, providing excellent accessibility and prominent frontage.\n\nThe lands benefit from an elevated gradient, offering attractive views across the surrounding countryside and towards the coastline. Located just five minutes' drive from Barna Village, the property is ideally positioned to enjoy the amenities and services of Barna, while also being within easy commuting distance of Galway City, which is approximately 1520 minutes away by car.\n\nThe coastal setting is a particular feature of this property, with the land located close to the shoreline and the scenic landscape of Galway Bay. The combination of its size, road frontage, elevated position and proximity to the coast presents an attractive opportunity for potential purchasers, subject to the necessary planning permissions and relevant planning requirements.\n\nThis is a particularly appealing holding in the popular Furbo/Barna area and is expected to attract interest from a variety of potential purchasers\n\nDNG Leonard & Heaslip for themselves and for the vendors or lessors of the property whose Agents they are, give notice that: (i) The particulars are set out as a general outline for the guidance of intending purchasers or lessees, and do not constitute part of, an offer or contract. (ii) Any intending purchasers or tenants must not rely the descriptions, dimensions, references to condition or necessary permissions for use and occupation as statements or representations of fact but must satisfy themselves by inspection or otherwise as to the correctness of each of them. (iii) No person in the employment of DNG Maxwell Heaslip & Leonard has any authority to make or give representation or warranty whatever in relation to this development. DNG Maxwell Heaslip &Leonard accept no liability (including liability to any prospective purchaser or lessee by reason of negligence or negligent misstatement) for loss or damage caused by any statements, opinions, information or other matters (expressed or implied) arising out of, contained in or derived from, or for any omissions from this brochure."
      },
